   <h3> Jezelle</h3>
   <p>
   
Member since: Sat Jan 20, 2001<br>
was last logged in: Wed Jun 13, 2001 at 11:47



<p><b>Full name:</b> Jezelle Shadowfoxx


<br><b>Profile:</b>
Level 51 Female Teir Dal Rogue


<br><b>Religion:</b>
Bristlebane

<br><b>Hord Rank:</b>
Horde Member



<p><b>Jezelle's Bio:</b>
<table border=1 width=400>
  <tr><td>
  (You walk into the Maiden's Fancy..upper level..a rather seedy establishment in Neriak's Third Gate. You spy the beautiful Tier'Dal sitting in a corner table, mead in one hand, dagger in the other.scratching pictures into the table. You sit and face her) 

     Ah...so what d' ye want? Oh? Th' truth about me is it...an' why shoul' I dredge up me past fer ye? Hmmm...I see, 50 platimum? Me memories don' come cheap...make it 500 an we gots a deal (smirking). Oh don't grimace...I know ye wanna hear this saucy tale..fork it over...that's a good lad (swipes the coin off the table and pockets it). Now...here's me little story....

  
     Th' first thing I remember was her face. A scornful...tearing face, as th' large, pale han's gripped me as a wee babe and carried me farther from her. Little did they know they would learn I carried th' same secret she did...an shoul' ave left me where I was. I never saw tha' woman again...I did hear her...screams...then silence. AHHH YES! This was th' time when I came inta th' "care" if you will...of Finnigan MacConnel. He was a filthy Barbarian, who lived in th' slums o' Freeport. He ran all sorts of scams. He had two favorite business practices;however. The first was havin children steal thin's from th' good citizens o' th' city..an givin it all t' him, in turn fer "food" an "protection". The second, well..he offered up th' most exotic whores in all o' Freeport. Whatever yer fancy! Ye likes them Tier'Dal vixens? Mabye ye ave' an intrest in somethin' scaly? Hell...how about an Ogre or Troll? (No..if this sickens ye...we ad' this one Ogre..she had nonstop customers...I never asked her secret). Anyhow..I; over time, was employed in BOTH fields. 


     Welll...fer th' most part o' me life...I was learnin th' ways o' th streets. Stealin, playin tricks, keepin better fed wi' all th' food I swiped fer meself. It was much fun fer me. Th life o' a criminal seemed truly fittin. I grew up workin wi' people o' many differan' races, an' religions, an' trades. I liked figurin ow' t' play up t' em all...jest t' score some cash offa em'. But, that came short lived. Despite me "business" savvy...Finnigan noticed ummmm...me "bloomin' assets"...AH! I'll jest say he saw me becomin' a nice specimin o' T&A. So, tha's how I started th' OTHER profession he ran. Okay..I can see ye wanna hear all th' details about THIS part o' me life, but some things can be kept private <smiles>..mabye I'll let ye find out what it was like fer 500 more platinum, but save it fer later. 


     After some time o' this...I went through a change. I noticed me belly swellin up. I had no idea wha' was goin' on. Some o' the other ladies explained t' me tha' I was....with child. This thought terrified me...an yet..t' think tha' I might live a normal life, like so many I have thieved from before. Th' others told Finnigan tha' I was sick..an needed t' be in isolation. They did this t' hide tha' I was pregnant...an' so they could help nurse me t' labor. Th' day came. OH HOW IT HURT!, but I squeezed tha' babe outta me. I was tired, but happy. Then, I noticed all th' others gaspin' an' murmerin'. I demanded t' know wha' was wrong <hangs her head> I wish I hadn't. They held th' child close t' me. An' I saw....I saw...<shaking> th' babe's skin was pale...PALE! I had Human blood inside o' me...dirty, filty, rotten, Human blood. I didn'a know wha' t' think. I still wanted this...thing. She was mine. I made her. Just then there was a commotion. Finnigan heard me screams an' came t' investigate. He ordered all th' ladies out...an' they obeyed. It was me an' him. 'Wha's th' bundle ye a've there?' He asked me. I told im' nothin. Ee' seemed fine wi' this...an' made t' leave. I was relieved....till he whipped around and snatched her from me 'ands. I coul' do nothin' I was too weak. He laughed an' said he had t' take her to an orphanage. He couldn't let anyone know tha' one o' 'is whores had a child...let alone wasn't a pure-blooded Tier'Dal...bad fer business he said. I made im promice she'd go t' th' best orphanage an' he swore to it. Then he left. 


     A couple months later. I decided t' go fer a walk in th' Western sector o' th' city. I wanted t' look out a' th' barren lands outside th' gate. As I was walkin', I spied me ol friend Boomba..hockin his pickles t' th' passerbys. What I saw as I approached...th' horror tha' sweped over me. Sittin on a shelf...was a baby...in a jar...my baby. Boomba saw me staring at it. Bein' slow...he said. "Yeah...dat one dere...Finnigan brought it t' me. Gen-u-ine Half Elf Baby Pickles. Me paid him top dollar fer it!". Before he could finish his sentence...I was storming towards Finnigan's hutch. I burst through the door an' saw him sittin at a table...eatin a meal. I threw aside th' table...an lifted him up by his collar. I jest remember lookin inta his eyes...seein...how suddenly...after all this time...he was old an' frail...while I was still young...in me prime. Me look of curiosity turned t' pure hate. I wrenched th' dagger out of his belt an' sliced his throat clean open. I dropped him, and left Freeport...tellin' meself i'd never return. 


     A few years later, I heard o' th' exploits of a group known as "Bloodhorde". I decided t' head straight fer th' founder...one Troll Mystic known as Zhokaii. She decided t' meet me...after I sent her an impressive letter. I suppose she was inspectin' some big, tough Seasoned Rogue. Instead she fin's me. Jest sittin there, smirkin. I had a feelin' she wanted t' eat me right there, but she seemed curious tha' one so young woul' seek her out directly. Well..t' make a long story short...she decided t' give me a try...an' here I am...these parts ye prolly know already. (Smirks) An' there ye have it...A look inta me background. Satisfied? (Watches you nod and take your leave from the table...then she squeezes your coin purse in her hand) I know I am.
   
  </td></tr>
